@startuml 模块逻辑架构包图
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
package "前端应用（Vue 3）" as FE
package "后端应用（Spring Boot 模块化单体）" {
  package "公共模块" as common
  package "身份认证模块" as identity
  package "基础目录模块" as catalog
  package "问诊模块" as consultation
  package "处方模块" as prescription
  package "药房模块" as pharmacy
  package "管理模块" as admin
}
database "关系数据库（MySQL）" as MySQL
FE --> identity : 接口调用
FE --> catalog
FE --> consultation
FE --> prescription
FE --> pharmacy
FE --> admin
identity ..> common
catalog ..> common
consultation ..> common
prescription ..> common
pharmacy ..> common
admin ..> common
catalog ..> identity : 用户查询端口
consultation ..> identity : 当前用户端口
consultation ..> catalog : 医生查询端口
prescription ..> consultation : 订单查询端口
prescription ..> catalog : 药品查询端口
pharmacy ..> prescription : 处方应用端口
admin ..> identity : 账号管理端口
admin ..> consultation : 问诊只读端口
admin ..> prescription : 处方只读端口
identity --> MySQL
catalog --> MySQL
consultation --> MySQL
prescription --> MySQL
admin --> MySQL
note bottom of common
公共模块不得依赖任何业务模块
end note
@enduml
